    "updated_at": "2026-08-24T03:09:55Z",
    "body": "Hi @linyueqian — I'd like to take the **per-concurrency first-audio-latency reporting** good-first-issue item (median + P99 over a concurrency sweep on the TTS benchmark path).\n\n**Plan**:\n1. Add per-concurrency first-audio-latency reporting to the TTS benchmark path (client-observed first audio chunk, median + P99, over a concurrency sweep).\n2. Emit it alongside the existing `--percentile-metrics` shape (e.g. `audio_ttfp`), so a single bench invocation produces a per concurrency table.\n3. Validate with a bounded GPU run and report the measured numbers.\n\nNo overlap with @liuyao0322's (#6515) and @CAICAIIs's Mechanism 2 + ρ. Could you assign me for this slice? thanks~",
